Water, sanitation and industrial utilities — from sources to continuing service (@water-and-sanitation: 0, is #chapter, #water-and-sanitation "foundations/Read-water-and-sanitation-from-zero.lingua#r_0KN6MHTA9SM9R7MK2CGT9KDJ35") { r_7B9GRCJFHVBEEQEXKWCR2QMMPN
Follow water from a source to its users and through collection, treatment, recovery and the receiving environment. Begin with [Read water and sanitation from zero](foundations/Read-water-and-sanitation-from-zero.lingua#r_0KN6MHTA9SM9R7MK2CGT9KDJ35), ordinary quantities and the work behind a tap, a drain or a factory water connection. Develop the physical, chemical, biological and institutional explanations as the questions become more demanding.

Use whole books and complete courses alongside the connecting explanations. Shared mathematics, measurements, chemistry, groundwater, fluid and electrical steps appear where their ideas are needed and retain their other continuations. The reading deepens into operation, design, modelling, experiments and independent research.

**Source assessment:** Continue after the foundation review through [catchment accounts](source-water/A-catchment-is-a-water-account-with-boundaries.lingua#r_0RWVH5WS933CGBP80NHR40WT2B), chronological availability, storage, aquifer capture, observation design, protection and blending. Finish with a defended source assessment; physical/chemical treatment follows.

**Physical and chemical treatment:** After source assessment, follow [treatment questions](treatment/Translate-raw-water-variation-into-treatment-questions.lingua#r_3M5Z05Q30W6P11QVNY3BF6ZZRS) through balances, shared chemical kinetics, mixed/plug-flow models, tracer evidence, hydraulics, dosing, coagulation, flocculation, settling, granular filtration, softening, adsorption, exchange and gas transfer. The [section review](treatment/Defend-the-physical-and-chemical-treatment-account.lingua#r_4KVPW53P76JBPM38N5AJRXNBX0) demands a reproducible process account; membranes, microbial barriers and distribution follow in the next section.

**Barriers and distribution:** Continue from the physical/chemical review into [membrane processes](barriers/Membrane-processes-and-the-question-of-separation.lingua#r_2Q10348P8FEN40SJ6SRG12Q8YT), recovery, integrity, microbial claims, exposure, UV validation and byproducts; then [materials in contact](distribution/Finished-water-stability-and-materials-in-contact.lingua#r_15RSX6EK77PKJZWCT3KRRBJZB2), networks, demand, storage, quality transport, interruption, repair and a versioned modelling study. The [section review](distribution/Defend-treatment-to-consumer-service-and-its-limits.lingua#r_30VN17MXVWHYGX6RTV84CYYA83) connects treatment to continuing service. Collection, wastewater and residuals follow next.

**Collection, wastewater and recovery:** Continue through [the collection entrance](collection/From-a-drain-to-a-receiving-environment.lingua#r_63NHMW0Q4G8VY4ENPKEEQQGWQN), flow/load histories, gravity conveyance, stormwater and decentralized service; then wastewater fractions, biological growth, retention, aeration, separation, process families and nutrient transformations. Original steady and batch programs support independently checked models. [Residuals](residuals/Dry-solids-water-and-the-material-called-sludge.lingua#r_5XZB8HTCR2TX7S9VZZ932AHCYH) connect dry-solids accounts, returned liquors, digestion, destinations and recovery to a [complete wastewater review](residuals/Defend-a-wastewater-service-from-collection-to-recovery.lingua#r_3C1VH3G7RHGDPAQPFN5D68S0V9). Industrial service, continuing operation and integrated studies follow.

**Industrial water and reuse:** Continue into [Water quality begins with the service it must deliver](industrial/Water-quality-begins-with-the-service-it-must-deliver.lingua#r_1EHYC601AFFNZ9FBF8J1Z9EPC8), separated streams, reuse balances, cooling, steam, condensate, high-purity service, residuals and inspectable process modelling. Shared thermal knowledge supports the equipment account. Finish with a defended industrial service.

**Continuing operation:** Follow [From the water to the measurement used in a decision](operations/From-the-water-to-the-measurement-used-in-a-decision.lingua#r_10B7MFX2X46JCS1C2WAKW0JECR) through measurement, shared feedback foundations, operating states, control systems, commissioning, maintenance, chronological reliability, restoration and the people/materials/finance that sustain service. An original storage model makes timing and unmet demand explicit.

**Advanced study:** [A whole water service is the subject of the investigation](research/A-whole-water-service-is-the-subject-of-the-investigation.lingua#r_5QD5W19FRQ40Y1AWERAP6HNYJT) branches into drinking-water delivery, wastewater plants and industrial reuse. These studies meet again at uncertainty, primary research and an independent investigation. [Water and sanitation — completion and continuing study](research/Water-and-sanitation-completion-and-continuing-study.lingua#r_1Y55JX0ZNS84JVY6AP315NWBFR) describes the sustained reading, calculations, evidence and research needed for a full educational completion claim.

**Foundations:** [Read water and sanitation from zero](foundations/Read-water-and-sanitation-from-zero.lingua#r_0KN6MHTA9SM9R7MK2CGT9KDJ35) · [A tap, a drain and the work between them](foundations/A-tap-a-drain-and-the-work-between-them.lingua#r_4BZY7VTHAE6B6WH956HKPZY906) · [Water quantities, units and English–Portuguese language](foundations/Water-quantities-units-and-English-Portuguese-language.lingua#r_6TB0A6YZ5C8E890HQ1BYSFE0F3) · [Water quality is related to a use and a place](foundations/Water-quality-is-related-to-a-use-and-a-place.lingua#r_3WKPW5Q04M3S2KF8EPB2K0FTDK) · [Track water and constituents through the same boundary](foundations/Track-water-and-constituents-through-the-same-boundary.lingua#r_4SA70P0BR6C7ADCR7MDV78D2D8) · [Read a water-system drawing and its boundaries](foundations/Read-a-water-system-drawing-and-its-boundaries.lingua#r_4EDEN8TRVC7KRWYHTJZ18G9VG9) · [Microorganisms, indicators and routes of exposure](foundations/Microorganisms-indicators-and-routes-of-exposure.lingua#r_6AFSE0XFBRE8Y27W0W57HGD017) · [Concentrations, species and analytical bases in water](foundations/Concentrations-species-and-analytical-bases-in-water.lingua#r_35TB3P0H9QMBS17JF52YF9W74Z) · [Alkalinity, hardness, buffering and carbonate boundaries](foundations/Alkalinity-hardness-buffering-and-carbonate-boundaries.lingua#r_59GA6HCRGGMESSYPMGFW2T7BE0) · [Oxygen, redox and the changing forms of constituents](foundations/Oxygen-redox-and-the-changing-forms-of-constituents.lingua#r_7SJ9QMVSF9TWJG7Z36EZ8R1YC4) · [Treatment barriers and the evidence for their performance](foundations/Treatment-barriers-and-the-evidence-for-their-performance.lingua#r_4KN934MCH4BZF0JMKMYN0VYRRB) · [Read health, environmental and equipment requirements](foundations/Read-health-environmental-and-equipment-requirements.lingua#r_20CZ4H0Z5Z92MH7VM5ED5K54J5) · [A water-sampling plan that answers a defined question](foundations/A-water-sampling-plan-that-answers-a-defined-question.lingua#r_2017E3G9XVF21MMQHJYNDQ2S7W) · [What a water measurement actually reports](foundations/What-a-water-measurement-actually-reports.lingua#r_72DBDSDN8STAHTN78JF0KKF6XR) · [Nondetects, variable flow and honest performance data](foundations/Nondetects-variable-flow-and-honest-performance-data.lingua#r_2W5V6AZSRSXK1CKFJ20BSAFN5F) · [Explain a water service before choosing equipment](foundations/Explain-a-water-service-before-choosing-equipment.lingua#r_1W8ZYY57AZEJ50E80HZHN59QSW).

[Water and sanitation sources — complete books, methods and operating evidence](Sources.lingua#r_7AMRJFFR11FF35KJM7Y7M05B3M) identifies the readings and their access conditions. Related work connects through [Utilities — water, energy and the services that sustain other work](../Utilities.lingua#r_23Z5YYXGRA1JDFD4BAM955JMNX), [Hephaestus](../../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001), [Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation](../../engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68), [Earth — materials, processes, and geological history](../../../gaia/earth/Earth.lingua#r_5H7Y6QD1FW4Z0JJ6C7SH4DDHXH), [Ergon — useful labor and productive knowledge](../../../Ergon.lingua#r_FE78A5A2D2A3261F711703DCC1) and [Inquiry — shared ways to understand and investigate](../../inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB). Questions about evidence, purposes and responsibility continue through [Philosophy](../../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001). The linked specialist subjects retain their own full scope.

**Continue:** [Read water and sanitation from zero](foundations/Read-water-and-sanitation-from-zero.lingua#r_0KN6MHTA9SM9R7MK2CGT9KDJ35).
} r_7B9GRCJFHVBEEQEXKWCR2QMMPN

